	(text "Cell voltage sense for firmware (fuel estimate + graceful shutdown at ~3.4V):\n1M/1M divider -> VBAT_SENSE (4.2V -> 2.1V) to PA3 / ADC1_IN3, 100nF for the ADC\nsample. ~2uA continuous. (VBAT_RTC can no longer be used: it sits behind the 3.0V LDO.)"
