	(text "RESERVED (DNP) for low-power v2: TPS63900 always-on\n3V3_AON (75nA Iq) for MCU + CAP1188. Replaces MAX17222,\nwhich is boost-only and cannot regulate a 3.65V cell down.\nVO(1) = 3.3V via CFG3 = 16.2k (SEL low); CFG1/CFG2 = 0R\n-> no input current limit. v1: R18 0R feeds 3V3_AON from\n+3V3. v2 TODO: EN needs its own UVLO (logic-level EN)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 342.9 30.48 0)
		(effects
